  "goodToKnow": "Mutwillig means wilful or deliberate, mostly of damage: mutwillig zerstören, beschädigen, mutwillige Sachbeschädigung (vandalism). Mut here keeps its old sense of mood or spirit, as in Gemüt and Übermut (high spirits), not courage. Synonyms: absichtlich, vorsätzlich, böswillig. The opposite is versehentlich (accidentally)."
